The '''Angor Digsite''' is an excavation site located in the mountains above [[Angor Fortress]] in the northern [[Badlands]]. [[Dark Iron dwarves]], led by [[Borrin Gloombeard]], are scouring the hilltop digging for valuable forgotten artifacts, risking ancient curses.<ref>[https://web.archive.org/web/20260514170802/https://turtlecraft.gg/new-locations-and-maps New Zones & World Edits]. Archived from [https://turtlecraft.gg/new-locations-and-maps the original] on 2026-05-14. Retrieved on 2026-29-08.</ref>

